The '''Start Deck 100 CoroCoro Comic Version''' (Japanese: '''スタートデッキ100 コロコロコミックver.''') is a Standard Deck for the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]. In Japan, the deck was only available through the Shogakukan publication ''[[CoroCoro|CoroCoro Comic]]'' and was first released in March 2022. The deck was later released in South Korea on May 27, 2022 under the name '''Start Deck 100 "Pikachu V and Eevee V"''' (Korean: '''스타트 덱 100 「피카츄 V & 이브이 V」'''), and in Taiwan and Hong Kong on October 2, 2022 under the name '''Start Deck 100 Special Edition''' (Traditional Chinese: '''初階牌組 100 特別版''').


Deck purchases were announced to be delivered in two waves in random assignment, and customers who completed their purchases were sent an email in mid March 2022 to confirm which delivery window they had been assigned to. The first wave was intended to be delivered in late March 2022, however as earlier shipments were done in plain envelopes without proper damage protection, many customers received damaged items and filed request for replacements, causing Shogakukan to pause the remaining shipments until April 2022, when the products were re-wrapped in proper packaging. Shogakukan promised to fulfill the replacement requests by May 2022. The second wave was initially announced to be delivered by late August 2022, but later moved to mid June 2022 due to manufacturing schedule adjustments.
